      "review_description": "Bruno Dromi was my point of contact with Discover Solar.  He was fast and no nonsense.  My original panels were over 10 years old, and at his suggestion, I replaced the entire system.  In hindsight, the solution he implemented was the best possible outcome.Mo and his team were professional and meticulous in carrying out the installation.  Mo had good communication skils and made himself accessible during the course of the installation.  They removed all rubbish at the conclusion of the installation, leaving our property clean and tidy.  The installation was more difficult than originally anticipated.  Additional equipment was required and a number of visits to complete it.  The grid connection took several attempts.  They persisted and successfully completed the installation in a timely manner.Bruno honoured the original quote, regardless of unanticipated additional time and equipment required by the installers.  This demonstrated integrity.",
