      "overall_rating": 0,
      "review_title": "",
      "review_description": "We were keen to have solar panels and a battery for a long time. Although there are a lot of installers and providers, it's hard to pick someone that you can trust and feel comfortable with. We were recommended Bruno from Discover Solar by a friend from the initial contact we right away felt comfortable with sales and quoting approach. When dealing with Bruno (operations manager) we didn't feel like we were being forced in to anything and the decision were in our control. We were presented with options to suit our budget and received an honest feedback on different models that we were considering, which made the selection of the panels, inverter and the battery easy. The process from quoting, signing of contract was easy and clear. It was good to deal with once person from start to finish. Once we paid a deposit the rest became even easier. The installers were highly skilful, arrived on time with all the equipment and the solar panels install was smooth considering the site complications. The inverter and the battery install was smooth and quick without any disruptions or inconvenience. Upon completion the installer explained how everything works and  assisted with the apps to monitor the  system. The inspector arrived and passed the workmanship first time without the need for the installer to re-attend. The panels, inverter and the battery all look very neat and tidy. The only thing that we will have to do is paint the mounting board to match the wall colour. The inverter and the batter were installed in the garage and the workmanship was very tidy. All cleaned up and rubbish taken away. We are happy with the service and the product we received and would highly recommend Bruno at Discover Solar to friend and family. Lastly it was nice to know that we are dealing with a local Melbourne based company rather than an unknown telemarketing organisation. Happy customer!",
